            "keepWithTag": { "printed": "played" },
            "why": "The typeset score keeps the 'printed' variant, which imitates the first edition's accidentals with glyphs drawn beside notes of the wrong pitch (ees with a drawn natural for E natural, f with a drawn sharp for F sharp); the 'played' variant is the same music at its true pitches with ordinary notation."
